{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54077","headline":"宝贤堂 · 李频","name":"宝贤堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游访曾经驻马看，窦犨遗像在林峦。\n泉分石洞千条碧，人在冰壶六月寒。\n时雨欲来腾雾霭，微风初动漾波澜。\n个中若置羊裘叟，绝胜当年七里滩。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》卷三○五《太原府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}